                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "### Signal path\n\nFaro browser tracing → `${svc_site_api}` → Redis and `${svc_orchestrator}` → specialist agents → Bedrock. The in-namespace Alloy sends OTLP metrics, logs and traces to Grafana Cloud. Agent Observability receives generations separately and runs online evaluations and the server guard.",
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
