                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "### Interpretation\n\nCost is a token-based estimate from list prices, not a Bedrock bill. Score metrics give pass/fail counts, while numeric scores and explanations remain in Agent Observability. Guard action counters are aggregate; a failed evaluator can still yield an overall allow action. Trace topology here is evidence of actual service calls; the Knowledge Graph builds its own edges from the service-graph rule this module installs.",
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
